msgstr "„I tak mi się tu nie podobało”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.15
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.15"
msgid "\"I've better places to be.\""
msgstr "„Muszę się gdzieś szybko dostać”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.16
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.16"
msgid "\"It's dirty down here.\""
msgstr "„Ale tu brudno”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.17
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.17"
msgid "\"Age makes fools of us all.\""
msgstr "„Wiek naigrywa się z nas wszystkich”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.18
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.18"
msgid "\"Just needed a rest.\""
msgstr "„Chciałem tylko odpocząć”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.19
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.19"
msgid "\"Five more minutes.\""
msgstr "„Jeszcze pięć minutek”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.2"
msgid "\"Don't even think about it.\""
msgstr "„Nawet o tym nie myśl.”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.20
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.20"
msgid "\"It's not as bad as it looks.\""
msgstr "„Nie jest tak źle, jak mogłoby się wydawać.”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.21
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.21"
msgid "\"Quoth the tallbird, Evermore.\""
msgstr "„Duptak krakał – kres i krach.”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.22
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.22"
msgid "It says \"Finally, some peace and quiet.\""
msgstr "„Wreszcie cisza i spokój”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.23
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.23"
msgid "It says \"Mind your own business.\""
msgstr "„Zajmij się swoimi sprawami”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.24
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.24"
msgid "It says \"Help, get me out!\" and \"Nah, just kidding,\" beneath."
msgstr "Na górze pisze: „Pomocy! Wyjmijcie mnie stąd!”, a niżej: „Żartowałem”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.25
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.25"
msgid "It reads \"Pulvis Et Umbra Sumus.\""
msgstr "„Pulvis et umbra sumus”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.26
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.26"
msgid "An engraving of their last words: \"I love it so much I could just die!\""
msgstr "Na nagrobku wygrawerowano ostatnie słowa zmarłego: „Tak dobrze się bawię, że zaraz umrę!”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.27
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.27"
msgid "An engraving of their last words: \"Hey, watch this.\""
msgstr "Na nagrobku wygrawerowano ostatnie słowa zmarłego: „Hej, sprawdź taki myk.”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.28
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.28"
msgid "An engraving of their last words: \"Uh-oh.\""
msgstr "Na nagrobku wygrawerowano ostatnie słowa zmarłego: „Ojej.”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.29
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.29"
msgid "An engraving of their last words: \"This is fine.\""
msgstr "Na nagrobku wygrawerowano ostatnie słowa zmarłego: „Wytrzyma.”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.3"
msgid "\"Here lies some guy.\""
msgstr "„Tu spoczywa jakiś gość.”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.30
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.30"
msgid "An engraving of their last words: \"I'm out of here.\""
msgstr "Na nagrobku wygrawerowano ostatnie słowa zmarłego: „Zabieram się stąd.”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.31
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.31"
msgid "An engraving of their last words: \"That's enough of that.\""
msgstr "Na nagrobku wygrawerowano ostatnie słowa zmarłego: „Starczy tego dobrego.”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.32
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.32"
msgid "An engraving of their last words: \"I'd rather die!\""
msgstr "Na nagrobku wygrawerowano ostatnie słowa zmarłego: „Wolę raczej umrzeć!”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.33
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.33"
msgid "An engraving of their last words: \"Uh, okay bye.\""
msgstr "Na nagrobku wygrawerowano ostatnie słowa zmarłego: „No dobra, to cześć.”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.34
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.34"
msgid "It reads \"Right behind you...\" and \"Made you look!\""
msgstr "„Za tobą.... Ha, ha, obejrzałeś się!”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.35
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.35"
msgid "\"Whoops.\""
msgstr "„Ups!”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.36
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.36"
msgid "It's cracked down the middle."
msgstr "Rysa przecina go na pół."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.37
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.37"
msgid "It says \"The end is only the beginning\"."
msgstr "„Koniec jest li tylko początkiem.”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.38
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.38"
msgid "It says \"I was underground before it was a thing.\" Huh?"
msgstr "Napisano tu, że „Zszedłem do podziemia, nim było to modne.” Ale że co?"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.39
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.39"
msgid "Someone left flowers."
msgstr "Ktoś zostawił kwiatki."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.4"
msgid "\"Here lies some gal.\""
msgstr "„Tu spoczywa jakaś dziewczyna.”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.40
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.40"
msgid "It's old and worn."
msgstr "Mocno nadszarpnięty zębem czasu."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.41
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.41"
msgid "It says \"Did I make it into the history books?\""
msgstr "„Napiszą o mnie w książkach do historii?”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.42
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.42"
msgid "It says \"I'm taking a nap. In the dirt.\""
msgstr "„Chcę się tylko zdrzemnąć”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.43
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.43"
msgid "It says \"These are just the pieces we could find.\""
msgstr "„Tylko te kawałki udało nam się znaleźć”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.44
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.44"
msgid "It says \"See you on the other side.\""
msgstr "„Do zobaczenia po drugiej stronie”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.45
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.45"
msgid "It says \"Catch you later.\""
msgstr "„Widzimy się później”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.46
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.46"
msgid "It says \"Don't make fun. You'll be here too one day.\""
msgstr "„Nie nabijaj się. Też tu kiedyś będziesz”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.47
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.47"
msgid "It says \"On to the next adventure.\""
msgstr "„Ku nowej przygodzie”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.48
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.48"
msgid "\"It's worse than it looks.\""
msgstr "„Jest gorzej, niż wygląda”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.49
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.49"
msgid "\"This is where I keep my stuff.\""
msgstr "„Tutaj trzymam swoje rzeczy”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.5"
msgid "\"Here lies some person.\""
msgstr "„Tutaj leży ktoś”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.50
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.50"
msgid "It says \"I'm just pretending.\""
msgstr "„Tylko udaję”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.51
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.51"
msgid "It reads \"Is the coast clear yet?\""
msgstr "„Wybrzeże już czyste?”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.52
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.52"
msgid "It says \"Lost and Found\"."
msgstr "„Biuro rzeczy znalezionych”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.53
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.53"
msgid "It says \"I hope I turned the oven off.\""
msgstr "„Mam nadzieję, że nie zapomniałem wyłączyć piekarnika”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.54
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.54"
msgid "It says \"Right where I belong.\""
msgstr "„Znalazłem swoje miejsce”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.55
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.55"
msgid "It says \"I guess this is my life now.\""
msgstr "„To będzie teraz moje życie”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.56
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.56"
msgid "\"Not sick, just coffin.\""
msgstr "„Jeszcze tylko jedna kawa”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.57
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.57"
msgid "\"Beware.\" Beware of what?"
msgstr "„Uwaga”. Uwaga na co?"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.58
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.58"
msgid "It's covered in a peaceful moss."
msgstr "Jest pokryty milutkim mchem."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.59
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.59"
msgid "It reads \"I've made a grave error.\" Hm."
msgstr "„Prywatny nagrobek. Nie czytać”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.6"
msgid "The headstone is blank."
msgstr "Tablica jest pusta."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.60
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.60"
msgid "It reads \"I can dig it.\" Oh."
msgstr "„Ciekawe, co jest w środku”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.61
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.61"
msgid "It reads \"Care to join me?\""
msgstr "„Ktoś chce dołączyć?”"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.62
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.62"
msgid "It reads \"Don't worry, it's cozy.\" That's nice."
msgstr "„Spoko, jest całkiem przytulnie”. Miło."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.63
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.63"
msgid "\"And don't come back.\""
msgstr "„I nie wracaj”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.64
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.64"
msgid "The inscription reads \"Always Watching\". Odd."
msgstr "„Zawsze czujny.” Dziwne."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.7"
msgid "\"Milk. Eggs. Bacon.\""
msgstr "„Mleko. Jajka. Bekon”."

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.8"
msgid "Huh? That's my name!"
msgstr "Hej, to moje imię!"

#. STRINGS.EPITAPHS.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.EPITAPHS.9"
msgid "It reads \"You're standing on my face.\" Oops."
msgstr "„Stoisz mi na twarzy”. Ups."

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_CLOSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_CLOSED.1"
msgid "I'll only talk to you if Mumsy says it's okay."
msgstr "Będziemy mogli rozmawiać tylko wtedy, jeśli Mamusia się zgodzi."

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_CLOSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_CLOSED.2"
msgid "Go talk to my mum. Baa."
msgstr "Pogadaj z moją mamusią. Baa."

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_CLOSED.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_CLOSED.3"
msgid "Can you ask my mum before we play?"
msgstr "Czy możesz zapytać moją mamę o zgodę?"

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_CLOSED.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_CLOSED.4"
msgid "Go ask Mumsy if we can play. Baa."
msgstr "Zapytaj mojej Mamusi, czy możemy się bawić. Baaa."

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_GREETING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_GREETING.1"
msgid "Pipton lets me have sweets, when Mumsy says it's okay."
msgstr "Pipton daje mi słodycze, jak mama się zgadza."

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_GREETING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_GREETING.2"
msgid "I like playing with the pebble crabs."
msgstr "Lubię bawić się z krabami."

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_GREETING.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_GREETING.3"
msgid "Our house used to be around here, baa."
msgstr "Nasz dom kiedyś tu stał, baa."

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_GREETING.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_GREETING.4"
msgid "Mumsy says my friends can't come out to play."
msgstr "Mamusia mówi, że moi przyjaciele nie mogą się ze mną bawić."

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_GREETING.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_GREETING.5"
msgid "I wish my bike still worked, baa."
msgstr "Szkoda, że mój rower jest zepsuty, baa."

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_GREETING.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_GREETING.6"
msgid "Sammy was a goat before, like mum and I."
msgstr "Sammy był kiedyś kozą. Jak mamusia i ja."

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_GREETING.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_GREETING.7"
msgid "Mumsy tells me not to look at the sky."
msgstr "Mamusia mówi, żeby nie patrzeć w słońce."

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_TRADE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_TRADE.1"
msgid "Baaaa! My favorite!"
msgstr "Baa! Uwielbiam!"

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_TRADE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_TRADE.2"
msgid "Oh, thanks!"
msgstr "Och, dzięki!"

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_TRADE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_TRADE.3"
msgid "We're friends now, right?"
msgstr "Teraz jesteśmy przyjaciółmi, prawda?"

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_TRADE.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_TRADE.4"
msgid "Baa!"
msgstr "Baa!"

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_TRADE.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_TRADE.5"
msgid "Mumsy says always to say \"thank-you\"."
msgstr "Mamusia zawsze mówi, że trzeba podziękować."

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_TRADE.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_TRADE.6"
msgid "Tradesies are fun."
msgstr "Lubię handlować."

#. STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_TRADE.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATKID_TALK_TRADE.7"
msgid "Baa, thanks!"
msgstr "Baa, dzięki!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS.1"
msgid "The Gnaw craves {craving}... {part2}"
msgstr "Gryzienia zaspokoi {craving}... {part2}"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS.2"
msgid "The Gnaw hungers for {craving}... {part2}"
msgstr "Gryzieniowi chodzi po głowie... Tak! {craving}... {part2}"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS.3"
msgid "The Gnaw desires {craving}... {part2}"
msgstr "{craving}... {part2} to marzenie Gryzienia..."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS.4"
msgid "The Gnaw wants {craving}... {part2}"
msgstr "Gryzień zażyczył sobie {craving}.... {part2}"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS.5"
msgid "The Gnaw craves {craving}!"
msgstr "Gryzień powiada, że ma pożreć {craving}!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS.6"
msgid "The Gnaw desires {craving}!"
msgstr "{craving}... {part2} to marzenie Gryzienia!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS.7"
msgid "The Gnaw hungers for {craving}!"
msgstr "Gryzień powiada, że  należne jest tu {craving}!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2.1"
msgid "I can tell, baa."
msgstr "Bez wątpienia, baa."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2.2"
msgid "I feel it."
msgstr "Czuję to."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2.3"
msgid "It's time to cook."
msgstr "Czas zabrać się za gotowanie."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2.4"
msgid "baa."
msgstr "Baa."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2.5"
msgid "I'm certain of it."
msgstr "Jestem tego pewna."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2.6"
msgid "You must oblige."
msgstr "Musisz spełnić żądanie."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2_IMPATIENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2_IMPATIENT.1"
msgid "or anything! Hurry, BAAA!"
msgstr "czy tam coś! Szybko, BAAA!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2_IMPATIENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2_IMPATIENT.2"
msgid "or whatever! Quick, BAAA!"
msgstr "lub cokolwiek! Szybko, BAAA!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2_IMPATIENT.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2_IMPATIENT.3"
msgid "BAAA! Hurry!"
msgstr "BAAA! Szybko!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2_IMPATIENT.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2_IMPATIENT.4"
msgid "there's no time!"
msgstr "nie ma czasu!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2_IMPATIENT.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_HINTS_PART2_IMPATIENT.5"
msgid "give it something! Anything!"
msgstr "daj mu coś! Cokolwiek!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.BREAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.BREAD"
msgid "a meal on BREAD"
msgstr "posiłek na CHLEBIE"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.CHEESE
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.CHEESE"
msgid "a meal with CHEESE"
msgstr "posiłek z SEREM"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.FISH"
msgid "FISH"
msgstr "RYBA"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.MEAT"
msgid "MEAT"
msgstr "MIĘSO"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.PASTA
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.PASTA"
msgid "PASTA"
msgstr "MAKARON"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.SNACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.SNACK"
msgid "a SNACK"
msgstr "PRZEKĄSKA"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.SOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.SOUP"
msgid "SOUP"
msgstr "ZUPA"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.SWEET
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.SWEET"
msgid "a DESSERT"
msgstr "DESER"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.VEGGIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MAP.VEGGIE"
msgid "a VEGETABLE dish"
msgstr "danie WARZYWNE"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MATCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MATCH.1"
msgid "Oh yes, {craving}! That'll buy you some time."
msgstr "Tak,  {craving}, doskonale! Zyskasz w ten sposób nieco czasu!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MATCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MATCH.2"
msgid "Yes, yes, {craving}! That should sate the beast."
msgstr "Tak, tak,  {craving}! To powinno zaspokoić głód bestii."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MATCH.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MATCH.3"
msgid "You found what the Gnaw craved!"
msgstr "Udało ci się odgadnąć, czego pragnie Gryzień!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MATCH.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MATCH.4"
msgid "The Gnaw's pleased with your offering."
msgstr "Gryzień rad jest z twej ofiary."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MATCH.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MATCH.5"
msgid "Mighty Gnaw! Feast now upon on {craving}!"
msgstr "Potężny Gryzieniu! Oto  {craving}! Zaspokój swój głód!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MISMATCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MISMATCH.1"
msgid "Well, it wasn't {craving}. But better than nothing!"
msgstr "No cóż. To nie  {craving}. Ale lepszy rydz niż nic!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MISMATCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MISMATCH.2"
msgid "That wasn't what the Gnaw craved, but we'll make do."
msgstr "Gryzień nie tego pragnął, ale to musi nam wystarczyć."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MISMATCH.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_CRAVING_MISMATCH.3"
msgid "I wouldn't call that {craving}, but oh well."
msgstr "To nie  {craving}. No, ale cóż."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_LOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_LOST.1"
msgid "It's over."
msgstr "Już po wszystkim."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_LOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_LOST.2"
msgid "The Gnaw's plague is upon you."
msgstr "Dopadła nas plaga Gryzienia."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_LOST.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_LOST.3"
msgid "I'm sorry I couldn't help more."
msgstr "Przykro mi, że nie mogłam bardziej pomóc."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_LOST.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_LOST.4"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "Żegnaj."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING.1"
msgid "If you can earn the Gnaw's favor... you might escape."
msgstr "Jeśli uda ci się zyskać łaskę Gryzienia... być może uda ci się stąd zbiec."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING.2"
msgid "The Gnaw's been around since I was just a lamb."
msgstr "Gryzień nawiedza te strony odkąd byłam jagnięciem."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING.3"
msgid "Another of your kind passed through here once."
msgstr "Przechodził tędy niegdyś jeden taki jak ty."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING.4"
msgid "Favor from the Gnaw might recharge the old key."
msgstr "Łaska Gryzienia może tchnąć moc w stary klucz."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING.5"
msgid "You must cook, or you will perish."
msgstr "Musisz gotować, bo inaczej marny twój los."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING.6"
msgid "Your presence here distracts it from Billy and I."
msgstr "Twoja obecność w tych stronach odwraca uwagę bestii ode mnie i Billy'ego."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING.7"
msgid "Are you... Gatekeepers, by chance?"
msgstr "Czy nie jesteście przypadkiem... Strażnikami Bramy?"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING_URGENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING_URGENT.1"
msgid "Hurry, please!"
msgstr "Szybko! Błagam!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING_URGENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING_URGENT.2"
msgid "The Gnaw is growing impatient!"
msgstr "Gryzień niecierpliwi się!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING_URGENT.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING_URGENT.3"
msgid "It must be fed, at all costs."
msgstr "Trzeba go nakarmić. Za wszelką cenę."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING_URGENT.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING_URGENT.4"
msgid "The Gnaw's demands know no end."
msgstr "Żądania Gryzienia nie mają końca."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING_URGENT.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING_URGENT.5"
msgid "I believe in you. You can do this."
msgstr "Wierzę w ciebie. Dasz radę."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING_URGENT.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING_URGENT.6"
msgid "Don't give up."
msgstr "Nie poddawaj się."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING_URGENT.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_GREETING_URGENT.7"
msgid "The Gnaw will cast down its plague if not fed!"
msgstr "Nakarm Gryzienia, bo inaczej ześle on tu swoją zarazę!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_BECKON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_BECKON.1"
msgid "Come a little closer."
msgstr "Podejdź no bliżej."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_BECKON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_BECKON.2"
msgid "Yoo-hoo, over here! Baa."
msgstr "Hej, hej! Tutaj! Baa."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_BECKON.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_BECKON.3"
msgid "Over here, dear!"
msgstr "Tutaj, złotko!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_BECKON.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_BECKON.4"
msgid "Wait! You need cookware!"
msgstr "Poczekaj! Potrzebujesz przyrządów kuchennych!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_BECKON.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_BECKON.5"
msgid "My dear, come closer."
msgstr "Podejdź bliżej, złotko."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_BECKON.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_BECKON.6"
msgid "There's no time to waste!"
msgstr "Nie ma czasu do stracenia!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_BECKON.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_BECKON.7"
msgid "Where are you going?"
msgstr "Dokąd się wybierasz?"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_CHOICE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_CHOICE.1"
msgid "You'll need one of my cookware kits."
msgstr "Potrzebny będzie ci jeden z moich zestawów kuchennych."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_CHOICE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_CHOICE.2"
msgid "Baa. Let's trade."
msgstr "Baa. Pohandlujmy."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_CHOICE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_CHOICE.3"
msgid "I have some spare cookware for trade."
msgstr "Mam tu nieco sprzętu kuchennego na handel."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_CHOICE.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_CHOICE.4"
msgid "Would you like a pot, an oven or a grill?"
msgstr "Czy życzysz sobie garnek, piecyk lub grill?"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_CHOICE.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_CHOICE.5"
msgid "Use those coins to trade with me, okay?"
msgstr "Użyj monet, aby ze mną pohandlować, dobrze?"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_CHOICE.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_CHOICE.6"
msgid "Let's trade. I'll get you set up."
msgstr "Pohandlujmy. Przygotujesz się u mnie jak nigdzie indziej."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_CHOICE.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_CHOICE.7"
msgid "I hope you're good in the kitchen, dear."
msgstr "Mam nadzieję, że dobrze radzisz sobie w kuchni, złotko."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_PURCHASE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_START_PURCHASE.1"
msgid "Wonderful choice, baa! Now, let's see..."
msgstr "Wspaniały wybór, baa! No dobrze, popatrzmy..."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_TRADE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_TRADE.1"
msgid "Thank-you, dear."
msgstr "Dziękuję, złotko."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_TRADE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_TRADE.2"
msgid "I hope it helps."
msgstr "Mam nadzieję, że to pomoże."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_TRADE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_TRADE.3"
msgid "You're welcome, baa."
msgstr "Nie ma za co, baa."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_TRADE.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_TRADE.4"
msgid "Good luck, dear."
msgstr "Powodzenia, złotko."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_TRADE.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_TRADE.5"
msgid "Take care, baa."
msgstr "Dbaj o siebie, baa."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_TRADE.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_TRADE.6"
msgid "Thank-you."
msgstr "Dziękuję."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_TRADE.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_TALK_TRADE.7"
msgid "Anything you need, dear."
msgstr "Co tylko potrzebujesz, złotko."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_VICTORY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_VICTORY.1"
msgid "Baa! The way is open!"
msgstr "Baa! Droga stoi otworem!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_VICTORY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_VICTORY.2"
msgid "Quickly, make haste to your world."
msgstr "Szybko, uciekajcie do swojego świata."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_VICTORY.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_VICTORY.3"
msgid "Billy and I'll follow soon behind."
msgstr "Billy i ja będziemy tuż za wami."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_VICTORY.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_VICTORY.4"
msgid "May we all leave this plague behind us."
msgstr "Może wszystkim nam uda się uciec od tej zarazy..."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_VICTORY.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_VICTORY.5"
msgid "Good luck, kind strangers!"
msgstr "Powodzenia, zacni przybysze!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_WELCOME_INTRO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_WELCOME_INTRO.1"
msgid "BAAA! Who are you?"
msgstr "BAA! Kto zacz?"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_WELCOME_INTRO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_WELCOME_INTRO.2"
msgid "No, there's no time for pleasantries!"
msgstr "Nie, nie ma czasu na uprzejmości!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_WELCOME_INTRO.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_WELCOME_INTRO.3"
msgid "You've got to get cooking, or you'll anger the beast!"
msgstr "Musimy zabrać się za gotowanie! W przeciwnym razie ryzykujemy gniew bestii!"

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_WELCOME_INTRO.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_WELCOME_INTRO.4"
msgid "I'll help how I can."
msgstr "Pomogę tak, jak będę umiała."

#. STRINGS.GOATMUM_WELCOME_INTRO.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.GOATMUM_WELCOME_INTRO.5"
msgid "Take these coins and see me when you're ready."
msgstr "Weź te monety i odwiedź mnie, gdy przyjdzie na to czas."

#. STRINGS.GREENAMULET_TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.GREENAMULET_TOOLTIP"
msgid "Reduced Material Cost"
msgstr "Obniża koszty tworzenia"

#. STRINGS.INSPECTMOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.INSPECTMOD"
msgid "Inspect"
msgstr "Zbadaj"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.random
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.random"
msgid "\nSelect a random character"
msgstr "\nWybierz losową postać"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr"
msgid "*Battle cries increase nearby allies' next attack damage by 25%\n*Gains less aggro when attacking\n\nExpertise:\nMelee, Darts"
msgstr "*Okrzyk bojowy zwiększa siłę następnego ataku pobliskich sojuszników o 25%\n*Ataki skupiają mniej uwagi wrogów\n\nBiegłość:\nWalka wręcz, Strzałki"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell"
msgid "*Summons Shadow Duelists after focusing attacks on a single target\n\n\nExpertise:\nBooks, Staves"
msgstr "*Skupia ataki na pojedynczym celu, po czym wzywa oponentów cienia\n\n\nBiegłość:\nKsiążki, kostury"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.webber
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.webber"
msgid "*Accompanied by itsy bitsy spiders\n\n\n\nExpertise:\nDarts"
msgstr "*Występuje wraz z chmarą uroczych pajączków\n\n\n\nBiegłość:\nStrzałki"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy"
msgid "*Protected by her twin sister, Abigail\n\n\n\nExpertise:\nDarts, Staves"
msgstr "*Chronia przez swoją siostrę bliźniaczkę, Abigail\n\n\n\nBiegłość:\nStrzałki, kostury"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wes
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wes"
msgid "*Can be revived twice as quickly\n*Gains minimal aggro when attacking\n*Less likely to lose aggro once drawn\n\nExpertise:\nMelee, Darts, Staves"
msgstr "*Można go ożywić dwa razy szybciej od innych\n*Ataki skupiają uwagę wrogów w minimalnym stopniu\n*Trudno mu uciec od skupionej uwagi wrogów\n\nBiegłość:\nWalka wręcz, strzałki, kostury"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom"
msgid "*Gains a buff after dealing sufficient damage, amplifying her next spell\n\n\nExpertise:\nBooks, Staves"
msgstr "*Po zadaniu wystarczających obrażeń otrzymuje premię wzmacnaijącą jej następne zaklęcie\n\n\nBiegłość:\nKsiązki, kostury"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.willow
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.willow"
msgid "*Protected by Bernie the Bear\n*Fire and Explosive attack damage increased by 10%\n\nExpertise:\nDarts, Staves"
msgstr "*Chroniona przez Misia Berniego\n*Zadawane obrażenia od ognia i eksplozji są zwiększone o 10%\n\nBiegłość:\nStrzałki, kostury"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson"
msgid "*Revives allies twice as quickly\n*Restores three times more health when reviving allies\n\nExpertise:\nMelee, Darts, Staves"
msgstr "*Wskrzesza sojuszników dwa razy szybciej od innych\n*Wskrzeszenia w jego wykonaniu przywracają trzykrotnie więcej zdrowie\n\nBiegłość:\nWalka wręcz, strzałki, kostury"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.winona
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.winona"
msgid "*All ability cooldowns are 10% faster\n\n\n\nExpertise:\nMelee, Darts, Staves"
msgstr "*Czas odnowienia wszystkich umiejętności jest skrócony o 10%\n\n\n\nBiegłość:\nWalka wręcz, strzałki, kostury"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wolfgang"
msgid "*Becomes Mighty when health is low, increasing attack power, defense, and movement speed for 10 seconds\n\nExpertise:\nMelee"
msgstr "*Gdy jego zdrowie jest na wyczerpaniu, staje się Mocarny, co zwiększa jego siłę ataku i obrony oraz szybkość ruchu na 10 sekund\n\nBiegłość:\nWalka wręcz"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie"
msgid "*Lucy returns to Woodie when thrown\n*Attack speed increased when wielding Lucy\n\nExpertise:\nMelee"
msgstr "*Rzucona Lucy wraca do Woodiego\n*Szybkość ataku jest zwiększona, gdy Lucy jest wyekwipowana\n\nBiegłość:\nWalka wręcz"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_canada
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_canada"
msgid "*Lucy returns to Woodie when thrown\n*Attack speed increased when wielding Lucy\n\nExpertise:\nMelee"
msgstr "*Rzucona Lucy wraca do Woodiego\n*Szybkość ataku jest zwiększona, gdy Lucy jest wyekwipowana\n\nBiegłość:\nWalka wręcz"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_us
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.woodie_us"
msgid "*Lucy returns to Woodie when thrown\n*Attack speed increased when wielding Lucy\n\nExpertise:\nMelee"
msgstr "*Rzucona Lucy wraca do Woodiego\n*Szybkość ataku jest zwiększona, gdy Lucy jest wyekwipowana\n\nBiegłość:\nWalka wręcz"

#. STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVAARENA_CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wx78"
msgid "*Shocks enemies when attacked\n*Electric attack damage increased by 50%\n\nExpertise:\nMelee"
msgstr "*Razi przeciwników prądem, gdy zostanie zaatakowany\n*Obrażenia od elektryczności zwiększone o 50%\n\nBiegłość:\nWalka wręcz"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.1"
msgid "It's so hot!"
msgstr "Ale gorąco!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.2"
msgid "Throw me!"
msgstr "Rzuć mnie!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.3"
msgid "I think we're winning!"
msgstr "Chyba wygrywamy!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.4"
msgid "They don't stand a chance!"
msgstr "Nie mają szans!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.5"
msgid "Gosh it's hot in here."
msgstr "Kurka wodna, ale skwar."

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.6"
msgid "Fight! Fight!"
msgstr "Walcz! Walcz!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.7"
msgid "Get'em!"
msgstr "Bierz ich!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.8"
msgid "Give them the chop!"
msgstr "Sieknij ich!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.equipped.9"
msgid "The crowd is so loud!"
msgstr "Ale tu gwar!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.missedenemy.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.missedenemy.1"
msgid "Whoops!"
msgstr "Ups!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.missedenemy.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.missedenemy.2"
msgid "I missed!"
msgstr "Spudłowałam!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.missedenemy.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.missedenemy.3"
msgid "Shoot!"
msgstr "Cel, pal!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.missedenemy.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.missedenemy.4"
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr "Hej!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.missedenemy.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.missedenemy.5"
msgid "Get back here!"
msgstr "Wracaj tu!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.other_owner.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.other_owner.1"
msgid "I'm not too crazy about this."
msgstr "Nie jestem specjalnie zachwycona."

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.other_owner.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.other_owner.2"
msgid "You're not holding me right!"
msgstr "Źle mnie trzymasz!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.other_owner.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.other_owner.3"
msgid "Your hands are clammy."
msgstr "Masz brudne ręce."

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.other_owner.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.other_owner.4"
msgid "Just throw me already!"
msgstr "No weź już mnie rzuć!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.other_owner.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.other_owner.5"
msgid "This won't be a regular thing."
msgstr "Nie będziemy tego powtarzać."

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.other_owner.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.other_owner.6"
msgid "Don't read too much into this."
msgstr "Nie oczekuj zbyt wiele."

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.struckenemy.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.struckenemy.1"
msgid "Gotcha!"
msgstr "Mam cię!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.struckenemy.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.struckenemy.2"
msgid "Take that!"
msgstr "A masz!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.struckenemy.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.struckenemy.3"
msgid "Take this!"
msgstr "Orient!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.struckenemy.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.struckenemy.4"
msgid "Bull's eye!"
msgstr "W dziesiątkę!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.struckenemy.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.struckenemy.5"
msgid "Ha!"
msgstr "Ha!"

#. STRINGS.LAVALUCY.struckenemy.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LAVALUCY.struckenemy.6"
msgid "Thwack!"
msgstr "Stuk!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.1"
msgid "Are you okay?"
msgstr "Wszystko w porządku?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.2"
msgid "You alright, big guy?"
msgstr "Wszystko okej, wielkoludzie?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.3"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Co jest?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.4"
msgid "Are you sure you're feeling alright?"
msgstr "Na pewno wszystko w porządku?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.5"
msgid "You're looking extra gruff today."
msgstr "Wyglądasz dziś wyjątkowo szorstko."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.6"
msgid "You look distracted."
msgstr "Zdajesz się być rozkojarzony."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.7"
msgid "Why are you making that face?"
msgstr "I po co taka mina?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_early.8"
msgid "Try to take deep breaths, okay?"
msgstr "Po prostu oddychaj głęboko, dobrze?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.1"
msgid "No! Don't chop any more!"
msgstr "Dość! Muszę zatamować twoje postępy!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.10"
msgid "Stop chopping, I'm getting nervous!"
msgstr "Przestań! Zaczyna mnie to denerwować."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.11"
msgid "Slow down, I'm worried about you!"
msgstr "Zwolnij trochę. Martwię się o ciebie!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.12
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.12"
msgid "Watch out! You're going to turn!"
msgstr "Uważaj! Zaraz się przemienisz!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.2"
msgid "The transformation is starting!"
msgstr "Przemiana rozpoczęła się!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.3"
msgid "One more chop and you're in trouble!"
msgstr "Jeszcze raz i będziesz miał kłopoty!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.4"
msgid "You're overdoing it!"
msgstr "Przesadzasz!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.5"
msgid "You're not pacing yourself!"
msgstr "Nie rozkładasz odpowiednio sił!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.6"
msgid "You're about to change!"
msgstr "Zaraz się zmienisz!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.7"
msgid "Take it easy!"
msgstr "Ostrożnie!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.8"
msgid "Ease up, you're looking a little bucktoothed!"
msgstr "Przestań się tak gryźć!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_late.9"
msgid "You've gotta slow down!"
msgstr "Musisz trochę zwolnić!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.1"
msgid "Hello? Can you hear me?"
msgstr "Cześć! Słyszysz mnie?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.2"
msgid "Isn't it about time for a nice wood snack?"
msgstr "Czy to nie pora na drewnianą przekąskę?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.3"
msgid "Woodie! Remember to eat your twigs!"
msgstr "Woodie! Proszę zjeść swoje gałązki!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.4"
msgid "You might want to eat a log."
msgstr "Może tak przekąsisz bal."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.5"
msgid "Mmm, bark... doesn't that sound good right now? Hm?"
msgstr "Mhm... Kora. Pyszni brzmi, prawda? Hm?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.6"
msgid "Have you been putting off your wood meals again?"
msgstr "Czyżbyś znowu pomijał swoje posiłki z drewna?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.7"
msgid "Hey, hey, have a woodchip."
msgstr "Hej, hej. Zjedz gałązkę."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_down_mid.8"
msgid "You know what happens if you don't eat enough wood!"
msgstr "Wiesz co się stanie, jeśli nie będziesz jeść dość drewna!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.1"
msgid "That was a close one!"
msgstr "Mało brakowało!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.2"
msgid "I think we'll be alright."
msgstr "Chyba wszystko będzie dobrze."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.3"
msgid "You're looking much better now."
msgstr "Wyglądasz znacznie lepiej."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.4"
msgid "It's passed. For now."
msgstr "Na razie minęło."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.5"
msgid "I was silly to doubt you."
msgstr "Tak mi głupio, że w ciebie wątpiłam."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.6"
msgid "Wow, I was afraid you were in for it!"
msgstr "Już się bałam, że po tobie!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.7"
msgid "I think the colour's returning to your cheeks."
msgstr "Chyba kolory wracają ci na policzki."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.beaver_up_waslow.8"
msgid "It's back in the lodge. Phew!"
msgstr "Wracamy na prostą. Uf!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.1"
msgid "Let's chop some trees!"
msgstr "Zetnijmy kilka drzew!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.10"
msgid "Chop chop chop. Heh."
msgstr "Pac, pac, pac. He, he."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.11"
msgid "Chop, c-c-chop!"
msgstr "Pac, trach!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.12
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.12"
msgid "So, stone trees... what's up with that?"
msgstr "No więc te kamienne drzewa... O co z nimi chodzi?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.13
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.13"
msgid "Let's find a small grove and just go nuts!"
msgstr "Znajdźmy sobie jakiś przyjemny zagajnik..."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.2"
msgid "Nice day for a walk!"
msgstr "Znakomity dzień na spacer!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.3"
msgid "We make a good team!"
msgstr "Zgrana z nas drużyna!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.4"
msgid "There must be some trees around here somewhere."
msgstr "Na pewno są tu w okolicy jakieś drzewa!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.5"
msgid "This is perfect chopping weather."
msgstr "Idealna pogoda na rąbanie."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.6"
msgid "A perfect day for some chopping."
msgstr "Doskonały dzień, aby coś ściąć."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.7"
msgid "You've got chops, buddy."
msgstr "Do dzieła, stary."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.8"
msgid "Hey! Chop some trees!"
msgstr "Hej! Zetnijmy jakieś drzewa!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.equipped.9"
msgid "All work and no play makes me want to chop some trees."
msgstr "Ciągła praca bez chwili zabawy wzmaga we mnie chęć rąbania!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.1"
msgid "It's dark in here!"
msgstr "Ciemno tu!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.10"
msgid "I can't see anything!"
msgstr "Nic nie widzę!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.11"
msgid "This is honestly the worst."
msgstr "Gorzej chyba być nie może."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.12
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.12"
msgid "I hate it in here."
msgstr "Nie podoba mi się tu."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.13
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.13"
msgid "What did I ever do to you?"
msgstr "Za jakie grzechy?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.2"
msgid "I'm scared!"
msgstr "Boję się!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.3"
msgid "Help! Get me out!"
msgstr "Pomocy! Wyjmijcie mnie stąd!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.4"
msgid "There's nothing to chop in here!"
msgstr "Nie ma tu czego rąbać!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.5"
msgid "This sucks."
msgstr "Co za padaka."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.6"
msgid "Getttt meeee outttt!"
msgstr "Nieech mnieee ktoooooś wyciągnie!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.7"
msgid "I'm claustrophobic!"
msgstr "Mam klaustrofobię!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.8"
msgid "I have a fear of tight spaces!"
msgstr "Boję się ciasnych przestrzeni!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.in_container.9"
msgid "I can't breathe! Wait."
msgstr "Nie mogę oddychać!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.1"
msgid "Woooooo!"
msgstr "Uuuuuuuu!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.10"
msgid "Woo-hoohoo!"
msgstr "Juuhuu!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.11"
msgid "RAAAA!"
msgstr "HAAA!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.12
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.12"
msgid "Die! Die!"
msgstr "Giń! Giń!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.13
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.13"
msgid "Chop! Chop!"
msgstr "Łup, łup!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.14
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.14"
msgid "Destruction!"
msgstr "Zniszczenie!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.15
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.15"
msgid "CHOP!"
msgstr "ŁUP!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.16
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.16"
msgid "This is AWESOME!"
msgstr "Ale SUPER!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.17
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.17"
msgid "Death to all trees!"
msgstr "Śmierć wszystkim drzewom!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.18
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.18"
msgid "Again! Let's chop another!"
msgstr "Następne! Zetnijmy następne!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.19
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.19"
msgid "Nice swing!"
msgstr "Ale rąbiesz!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.2"
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr "Tak jest!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.20
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.20"
msgid "Too easy!"
msgstr "Łatwizna!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.3"
msgid "Stupid tree!"
msgstr "Głupie drzewsko!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.4"
msgid "Nom nom nom!"
msgstr "Nom, nom, nom!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.5"
msgid "We did it!"
msgstr "Udało nam się!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.6"
msgid "I feel ALIVE!"
msgstr "Wreszcie czuję, że żyję!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.7"
msgid "HaHAHA!"
msgstr "HA, HA, HA!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.8"
msgid "YEEEESS!"
msgstr "TAAAAK!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_chopped.9"
msgid "This is what I live for!"
msgstr "Sens mojego życia!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.1"
msgid "You'll come back, right?"
msgstr "Ale wrócisz, prawda?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.10"
msgid "Aren't we friends?"
msgstr "Nie jesteśmy przyjaciółmi?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.11"
msgid "Who chucks a talking axe?!"
msgstr "Kto by wyrzucił gadającą siekierę?!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.12
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.12"
msgid "I... don't understand!"
msgstr "Ale.... Nic nie rozumiem!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.13
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.13"
msgid "Can we talk about this?"
msgstr "Możemy o tym pogadać?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.14
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.14"
msgid "Don't forget about me!"
msgstr "Tylko mnie nie zapomnij!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.15
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.15"
msgid "Oof!"
msgstr "Uuf!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.16
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.16"
msgid "I don't like where this is going."
msgstr "Nie podoba mi się kierunek wydarzeń."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.17
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.17"
msgid "Are... are you gonna make like a tree?"
msgstr "Czyżbyś... Czyżbyś zamierzał odejść?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.18
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.18"
msgid "Ouch!"
msgstr "Auć!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.2"
msgid "What did I say?"
msgstr "Powiedziałam coś nie tak?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.3"
msgid "Oh, that's low."
msgstr "Och, co za poniżenie."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.4"
msgid "Don't leave! I... I think I smell roses!"
msgstr "Nie odchodź! Czuję... Czuję zapach róż!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.5"
msgid "I know this is only temporary..."
msgstr "Wiem, że to tylko chwilowo..."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.6"
msgid "Awww..."
msgstr "Oooch..."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.7"
msgid "Oh, is that how it is?!"
msgstr "A więc to tak?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.8"
msgid "Hey! I'd never throw you away!"
msgstr "Hej! Ja bym cię nigdy nie odrzuciła!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_dropped.9"
msgid "Why would you throw me away?"
msgstr "Dlaczego mnie odtrącasz?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.1"
msgid "Come back! Take we with you!"
msgstr "Wróć! Weź mnie ze sobą!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.10"
msgid "Hey! Get back over here!"
msgstr "Hej! Wracaj tu!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.11"
msgid "I can't chop trees by myself!"
msgstr "Sama drzewa nie zetnę!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.12
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.12"
msgid "So... lonely..."
msgstr "Samotność mnie zabije..."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.13
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.13"
msgid "I guess I'll just stay here then..."
msgstr "To ja tu chyba zostanę..."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.14
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.14"
msgid "What if I get stolen?!"
msgstr "A jak mnie ukradną?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.2"
msgid "Where did you go?"
msgstr "Gdzie poszedłeś?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.3"
msgid "Take me with you!"
msgstr "Zabierz mnie ze sobą!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.4"
msgid "It's cold!"
msgstr "Zimno!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.5"
msgid "I'm getting dirty!"
msgstr "Ubrudzę się!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.6"
msgid "There's monsters around you know!"
msgstr "W okolicy grasują potwory!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.7"
msgid "I resent that!"
msgstr "Nie cierpię tego!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.8"
msgid "You're abandoning me?!"
msgstr "Zostawiasz mnie?!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_ground.9"
msgid "But... but we're inseparable!"
msgstr "Ale... przecież jesteśmy nierozłączni!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.1"
msgid "Ouch, that hurts."
msgstr "Auć. To bolało."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.10"
msgid "What did I ever do to you!?"
msgstr "Co ja ci w ogóle zrobiłam?!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.11"
msgid "You're the ghostest with the mostest!"
msgstr "Ty to dopiero jesteś duch!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.12
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.12"
msgid "Don't take it out on me just 'cause you're dead!"
msgstr "Nie wyżywaj się na mnie tylko dlatego, że nie żyjesz!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.13
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.13"
msgid "If you were corporeal I'd chop you!"
msgstr "Gdyby nie to, że nie masz ciała, już dawno bym cię dopadła!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.14
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.14"
msgid "OOooOOooOOoo! Haha, just kidding."
msgstr "OOooOOooOOoo! Haha, tylko żartuję."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.15
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.15"
msgid "Creepy!"
msgstr "Trochę straszny!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.16
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.16"
msgid "Brrr! You're cold!"
msgstr "Brr! Ale zimno!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.17
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.17"
msgid "You got ectoplasm on my handle!!"
msgstr "No i pięknie! Cała jestem pokryta ektoplazmą."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.18
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.18"
msgid "Knock it off!"
msgstr "Przestań!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.19
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.19"
msgid "Rude!"
msgstr "To niegrzeczne!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.2"
msgid "ooOOoooOO to you too."
msgstr "„ooOOoooOO” tobie też."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.20
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.20"
msgid "I am an axe possessed!"
msgstr "Jestem nawiedzoną siekierą!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.21
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.21"
msgid "Pick on someone your own size!"
msgstr "Czep się kogoś w twoim rozmiarze!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.22
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.22"
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr "Hej!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.23
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.23"
msgid "Jeez! Did I anger you in a past life?"
msgstr "Kurka no! Zawiniłam ci jakoś w poprzednim życiu czy co?!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.24
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.24"
msgid "I'm white as a sheet."
msgstr "Jestem biała jak prześcieradło."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.25
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.25"
msgid "You're looking boo-tiful today."
msgstr "Wyglądasz dziś wprost zabójczo."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.3"
msgid "Now I'm a HAUNTED axe."
msgstr "Ja to dopiero jestem NAWIEDZONA."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.4"
msgid "I'm not scared of you, ghost!"
msgstr "Nie boję się ciebie, duchu!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.5"
msgid "Boo who?"
msgstr "Na kogo buczymy?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.6"
msgid "I've seen scarier."
msgstr "Widziałam gorsze rzeczy."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.7"
msgid "You think I'm afraid of you?"
msgstr "Myślisz, że się ciebie boję?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.8"
msgid "Do you worst, ghost."
msgstr "Czyń swą powinność, duchu."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_haunt.9"
msgid "Go bother someBODY else! Haha."
msgstr "Zaczepiaj KOGOŚ innego, hahaha!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.1"
msgid "I missed you so much!"
msgstr "Ależ tęskniłam!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.10"
msgid "Did you miss me?"
msgstr "Tęskniłeś?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.11"
msgid "Together again!"
msgstr "Znów razem!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.2"
msgid "Ahhh, I'm back where I belong."
msgstr "Aaach. Wreszcie tam, gdzie moje miejsce."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.3"
msgid "It feels so good to be reunited!"
msgstr "Tak dobrze znowu być razem!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.4"
msgid "I was afraid you'd never come back."
msgstr "Bałam się, że już nigdy nie wrócisz."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.5"
msgid "You came back for me!"
msgstr "Wróciłeś po mnie!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.6"
msgid "Oh, thank goodness."
msgstr "Niebiosom niech będą dzięki."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.7"
msgid "Oh, it was awful!"
msgstr "To było okropne!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.8"
msgid "Never do that again! My little heart can't take it."
msgstr "Nie rób tego więcej! Moje malutkie serce tego nie zniesie."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_pickedup.9"
msgid "From now on we'll be inseparable."
msgstr "Od teraz będziemy nierozłączni."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.1"
msgid "You two-timer!"
msgstr "Rozpustniku jeden!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.10"
msgid "She's an impostor!"
msgstr "Ona jest oszustką!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.11"
msgid "It's like you don't even know me!"
msgstr "Czuję się, jakbyś mnie zupełnie nie znał!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.12
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.12"
msgid "Get rid of her! It's freaking me out."
msgstr "Pozdbądź się jej! Oszaleję przez nią."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.13
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.13"
msgid "I'm having an identity crisis over here."
msgstr "Mam tu mały kryzys tożsamości."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.14
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.14"
msgid "Oh, you're just AXING for trouble!"
msgstr "Zaraz tu polecą wióry!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.15
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.15"
msgid "You can't have two Lucys!"
msgstr "Lucy jest tylko jedna!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.16
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.16"
msgid "You can't have him! He's mine!"
msgstr "Nie możesz go mieć! Jest mój!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.2"
msgid "But I'M your one and only Lucy!"
msgstr "Ale to JA jestem jedyną i niepowtarzalną Lucy!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.3"
msgid "There can be only one!"
msgstr "Może być tylko jeden zwycięzca!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.4"
msgid "How dare you do this to me!"
msgstr "Jak możesz mi to robić?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.5"
msgid "You're replacing me?!"
msgstr "Chcesz mnie wymienić?!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.6"
msgid "That's not me!"
msgstr "To nie ja!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.7"
msgid "Betrayal!"
msgstr "Zdrada!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.8"
msgid "Ooo I'll remember that!"
msgstr "Ooooch, zapamiętam to sobie!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.on_woodie_pickedup_other.9"
msgid "Hey! Can't you tell us apart?"
msgstr "Hej! Nie potrafisz nas rozróżnić?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.1"
msgid "I don't know you."
msgstr "Nie znamy się."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.10"
msgid "Get your mitts off me!"
msgstr "Zabieraj łapska!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.11"
msgid "Drop me this instant!"
msgstr "Odłóż mnie natychmiast!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.12
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.12"
msgid "How dare you pick me up?!"
msgstr "Jak śmiesz mnie podnosić?!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.13
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.13"
msgid "Yuck, your hands are greasy!"
msgstr "Ble! Ale masz tłuste łapy!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.14
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.14"
msgid "Let me go!"
msgstr "Puść mnie!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.15
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.15"
msgid "Help! I'm being kidnapped."
msgstr "Pomocy! Porywają mnie!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.16
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.16"
msgid "Stranger danger!"
msgstr "Nie rozmawiam z nieznajomymi!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.2"
msgid "Put me down!"
msgstr "Odłóż mnie!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.3"
msgid "Hey! Fresh!"
msgstr "Hej! A to ci nowość!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.4"
msgid "Gross."
msgstr "Obrzydliwe."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.5"
msgid "Excuse you!"
msgstr "Co ty robisz?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.6"
msgid "Ummmm, EXCUSE me??"
msgstr "Ekhm, HALO?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.7"
msgid "Leave me alone, you brute!"
msgstr "Zostaw mnie w spokoju, brutalu!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.8"
msgid "Put me down! You smell!"
msgstr "Odłóż mnie! Ale od ciebie jedzie!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.other_owner.9"
msgid "Did I say you could take me?"
msgstr "Mówiłam, że można mnie dotykać?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.1"
msgid "Oh no!"
msgstr "Och, nie!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.2"
msgid "You have to fight it!"
msgstr "Musisz z tym walczyć!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.3"
msgid "No! Fight it!"
msgstr "Nie! Walcz!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.4"
msgid "You've gotta resist!"
msgstr "Musisz się oprzeć!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.5"
msgid "It happened again!"
msgstr "Znowu to samo!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.6"
msgid "The curse!"
msgstr "Przekleństwo!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.7"
msgid "Not again!"
msgstr "Znowu to samo!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.8"
msgid "You don't have to do this!"
msgstr "Nie musisz tego robić!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_beaver.9"
msgid "I warned you!"
msgstr "Ostrzegałam!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.1"
msgid "You're back!"
msgstr "Wróciłeś!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.10"
msgid "You look much better."
msgstr "Wyglądasz znacznie lepiej."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.11"
msgid "Phew! That was scary!"
msgstr "Uff! To było dość straszne!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.12
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.12"
msgid "I'm glad it's over..."
msgstr "Cieszę się, że już po wszystkim..."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.13
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.13"
msgid "Let's not do that again."
msgstr "Nie róbmy tego więcej."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.14
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.14"
msgid "Remember your breathing exercises!"
msgstr "Pamiętaj o twoim treningu! Oddychaj!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.15
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.15"
msgid "Everything is going to be fine. Just focus!"
msgstr "Wszystko będzie dobrze. Skup się!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.2"
msgid "Are you okay?"
msgstr "Wszystko w porządku?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.3"
msgid "That was a rough one, huh?"
msgstr "Ostra jazda, co?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.4"
msgid "Don't let that happen again!"
msgstr "Niech to się więcej nie powtórzy!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.5"
msgid "You scared me!"
msgstr "Przestraszyłeś mnie!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.6"
msgid "I think that creepy girl is mad at you."
msgstr "Myślę, że ta upiorna dziewczyna jest na ciebie wściekła."

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.7"
msgid "I'm so glad you're alright!"
msgstr "Tak się cieszę, że wszystko z tobą w porządku!"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.8"
msgid "Whew! Still in one piece?"
msgstr "Uff! Wciąż w jednym kawałku?"

#. STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.LUCY.transform_woodie.9"
msgid "It's good to have you back, buddy."
msgstr "Dobrze, że wróciłeś, stary."

#. STRINGS.MAPRECORDER.LOCATION.CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAPRECORDER.LOCATION.CAVE"
msgid " in the caves"
msgstr " w jaskiniach"

#. STRINGS.MAPRECORDER.LOCATION.DEFAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAPRECORDER.LOCATION.DEFAULT"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.MAPRECORDER.MAPDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAPRECORDER.MAPDESC"
msgid "Mapped{location} by {author} on day {day}."
msgstr "Stworzone{location} przez {author} dnia {day}"

#. STRINGS.MAPRECORDER.UNKNOWN_AUTHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAPRECORDER.UNKNOWN_AUTHOR"
msgid "an explorer"
msgstr "odkrywca"

#. STRINGS.MAPRECORDER.UNKNOWN_DAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAPRECORDER.UNKNOWN_DAY"
msgid "???"
msgstr "???"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_1.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_1.ONE"
msgid "Oh, you found my portal did you?"
msgstr "A więc udało ci się znaleźć mój portal?"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_1.THREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_1.THREE"
msgid "Hmm. Let's try something a little more challenging, shall we?"
msgstr "Może spróbujemy czegoś trudniejszego. Co ty na to?"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_1.TWO
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_1.TWO"
msgid "You'd think you would have learned your lesson by now."
msgstr "Myślałem, że już się czegoś nauczysz."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_2.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_2.ONE"
msgid "Well would you look at that, you survived."
msgstr "Proszę, proszę. Udało ci się przeżyć."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_2.TWO
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_2.TWO"
msgid "One down, four to go!"
msgstr "Jeden z głowy, zostały tylko cztery."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_3.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_3.ONE"
msgid "What? You're still here?"
msgstr "Co? Wciąż tu jesteś?"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_3.TWO
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_3.TWO"
msgid "Impressive. But you should probably stop while you're ahead."
msgstr "Imponujące. Mam jednak dla ciebie małą sugestię – odpuść sobie, póki jeszcze możesz."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_4.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_4.ONE"
msgid "Say, pal."
msgstr "Witaj!"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_4.THREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_4.THREE"
msgid "Turn back now, or I may have to resort to drastic measures."
msgstr "Wycofaj się, bo będę musiał zastosować drastyczne środki."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_4.TWO
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_4.TWO"
msgid "You're really pushing your luck."
msgstr "Naprawdę kusisz los."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_5.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_5.ONE"
msgid "You insolent, pitiful, insignificant ant!"
msgstr "Ty bezczelny, żałosny, beznadziejny robalu!"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_5.THREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_5.THREE"
msgid "You will regret coming any further..."
msgstr "Jeszcze krok i pożałujesz..."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_5.TWO
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_5.TWO"
msgid "Do not arouse the wrath of the Great Maxwell!"
msgstr "Lepiej nie budź gniewu Maxwella Wspaniałego!"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.COMBATFAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.COMBATFAIL.1"
msgid "Where would be the sport in that?"
msgstr "I gdzie tu zabawa?"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.COMBATFAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.COMBATFAIL.2"
msgid "Who do you think allowed you to make that?"
msgstr "Jak sądzisz, kto pozwolił ci to zrobić?"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.1"
msgid "Is this what you were expecting?"
msgstr "Nie takie były twoje oczekiwania?"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.10"
msgid "Just dust. And the void. And Them."
msgstr "Tylko pył. I pustka. I Oni."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.11"
msgid "I've learned so much since then. I've built so much."
msgstr "Dużo się w tym czasie nauczyłem. Dużo zbudowałem."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.12
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.12"
msgid "But even a King is bound to the board."
msgstr "Ale nawet król musi stać na szachownicy."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.13
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.13"
msgid "You can't change the rules of the game."
msgstr "Nie można zmienić zasad gry."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.14
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.14"
msgid "I don't know what they want. They... they just watch."
msgstr "Nie wiem, czego chcą. Po prostu... patrzą."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.15
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.15"
msgid "Unless you get too close. Then..."
msgstr "Chyba że podejdziesz za blisko. Wtedy..."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.16
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.16"
msgid "Well, there's a reason I stay so dapper."
msgstr "Cóż, nie bez powodu jestem taki elegancki."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.17
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.17"
msgid "What year is it out there? Time moves differently here."
msgstr "Który rok jest w tamtym świecie? Czas płynie tu inaczej."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.18
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.18"
msgid "Go on, stay a while. Keep us company."
msgstr "Zostań chwilę. Dotrzymaj nam towarzystwa."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.19
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.19"
msgid "Or put the key in the box. It's your decision."
msgstr "Albo włóż klucz do pudełka. Decyzja należy do ciebie."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.2"
msgid "Forgive me if I don't get up."
msgstr "Wybacz, że nie wstaję."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.20
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.20"
msgid "Either way, you're just delaying the inevitable."
msgstr "Tak czy owak, jedynie odwlekasz nieuniknione."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.21
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.21"
msgid "Reality is like that, sometimes."
msgstr "Taka bywa rzeczywistość."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.22
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.22"
msgid "I think I've said enough."
msgstr "Chyba dość już powiedziałem."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.23
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.23"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.3"
msgid "You've been an interesting plaything, but I've grown tired of this game."
msgstr "Wspaniały z ciebie pionek, ale mam już dość tej gry."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.4"
msgid "Or maybe They've grown tired of me."
msgstr "A może Oni mają dość mnie."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.5"
msgid "Heh. Took them long enough."
msgstr "Hmm. Długo im zeszło."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.6"
msgid "They'll show you terrible, beautiful things."
msgstr "Pokażą ci przerażające, piękne rzeczy."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.7"
msgid "It will change you, like it did me."
msgstr "Odmieni cię to, tak jak odmieniło mnie."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.8"
msgid "It's best not to fight it."
msgstr "Lepiej z tym nie walczyć."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.CONVERSATION.9"
msgid "There wasn't much here when I showed up."
msgstr "Niewiele tu było, gdy się pojawiłem."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.ONE"
msgid "Well, this is it."
msgstr "Dokonało się."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.TELEPORTFAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.TELEPORTFAIL"
msgid "Don't you think I've tried that?"
msgstr "Myślisz, że nie próbowałem?"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.TELEPORTFAIL2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.TELEPORTFAIL2"
msgid "This is the end of the line. We have no escape."
msgstr "To koniec. Nie ma ucieczki."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.TWO
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.LEVEL_6.TWO"
msgid "You found me. Now, what are you going to do?"
msgstr "Udało ci się mnie znaleźć. I co teraz zrobisz?"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.TWOLANDS.FOUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.TWOLANDS.FOUR"
msgid "All I want in return is a truce."
msgstr "W zamian chcę jedynie pokoju."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.TWOLANDS.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.TWOLANDS.ONE"
msgid "Say, pal."
msgstr "Witaj!"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.TWOLANDS.THREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.TWOLANDS.THREE"
msgid "I'll give you food, gold, pigs, whatever you need."
msgstr "Dam ci jedzenie, złoto, prosiaki, czego tylko będziesz potrzebować."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.TWOLANDS.TWO
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTUREINTROS.TWOLANDS.TWO"
msgid "Let's make a deal. You can stay here. Settle down, even."
msgstr "Dogadajmy się. Możesz tu zostać. Osiedlić się nawet."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURETHRONE.LEVEL_6.HIT.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURETHRONE.LEVEL_6.HIT.ONE"
msgid "The throne won't allow that. I've tried."
msgstr "Tron nie pozwoli na coś takiego. Próbowałem."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURETHRONE.LEVEL_6.INTRO.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURETHRONE.LEVEL_6.INTRO.ONE"
msgid "Is this how it ends?"
msgstr "Czyżby tak miało się to skończyć?"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURETHRONE.LEVEL_6.NOUNLOCK.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURETHRONE.LEVEL_6.NOUNLOCK.ONE"
msgid "Ah, I am a fool. I had dared to hope."
msgstr "Ach, głupiec ze mnie. Pozwoliłem sobie na odrobinę nadziei."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURETHRONE.LEVEL_6.PHONOGRAPHOFF.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURETHRONE.LEVEL_6.PHONOGRAPHOFF.ONE"
msgid "Thank you. I have been listening to that song for an eternity."
msgstr "Dzięki. Słuchałem tej piosenki całą wieczność."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURETHRONE.LEVEL_6.PHONOGRAPHON.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURETHRONE.LEVEL_6.PHONOGRAPHON.ONE"
msgid "I guess I deserve that."
msgstr "Chyba sobie zasłużyłem."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_4.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_4.ONE"
msgid "Fine. Just remember that you chose this."
msgstr "Jak chcesz. Tylko pamiętaj, że to twoja decyzja."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_6.FOUR.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_6.FOUR.ONE"
msgid "It's just that..."
msgstr "Chodzi o to, że..."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_6.FOUR.TWO
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_6.FOUR.TWO"
msgid "I've become accustomed to winning."
msgstr "Przyzwyczaiłem się do wygrywania."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_6.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_6.ONE"
msgid "We're not so different, you and I."
msgstr "Jesteśmy bardzo podobni."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_6.THREE.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_6.THREE.ONE"
msgid "Oh, did you think you were the first?"
msgstr "Och, wydawało ci się, że nikogo przed tobą nie było?"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_6.THREE.TWO
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_6.THREE.TWO"
msgid "HA!"
msgstr "HA!"

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_6.TWO.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_6.TWO.ONE"
msgid "That's why I brought you here."
msgstr "Dlatego cię tu sprowadziłem."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_6.TWO.TWO
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_ADVENTURE_HEAD.LEVEL_6.TWO.TWO"
msgid "That's why I brought all of them here."
msgstr "Dlatego ich tu sprowadziłem."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_SANDBOXINTROS.ONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_SANDBOXINTROS.ONE"
msgid "Say pal, you don't look so good."
msgstr "Witaj! Nie wyglądasz najlepiej."

#. STRINGS.MAXWELL_SANDBOXINTROS.TWO
msgctxt "STRINGS.MAXWELL_SANDBOXINTROS.TWO"
msgid "You'd better find something to eat before night comes!"
msgstr "Lepiej znajdź sobie coś do jedzenia, zanim się ściemni!"

#. STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_GREETING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_GREETING.1"
msgid "Thoughts don't come to me like they used to."
msgstr "Moje myśli nie są tak przejrzyste jak niegdyś."

#. STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_GREETING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_GREETING.2"
msgid "Who's Mumsy again? Ah, right. Nice lady."
msgstr "Kim jest ta cała Mamusia? Ach, tak. Miła pami."

#. STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_GREETING.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_GREETING.3"
msgid "Been havin' odd cravings for fish lately. Hmf."
msgstr "Od jakiegoś czasu strasznie chodzą za mną ryby. Dziwne."

#. STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_GREETING.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_GREETING.4"
msgid "Pip's too uptight. Always worryin' about me."
msgstr "Pip za bardzo się o mnie martwi."

#. STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_GREETING.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_GREETING.5"
msgid "Hey, trade with ol'Sammy!"
msgstr "Hej! Pohandluj ze starym Sammym!"

#. STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_GREETING.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_GREETING.6"
msgid "SEEDS! SEEDS HERE!"
msgstr "NASIONA! NASIONA! NASIONA!"

#. STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_GREETING.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_GREETING.7"
msgid "What was I doing? ...Oh, SEEDS HERE!"
msgstr "Co to ja..? Och! NASIONA SPRZEDAJĘ!"

#. STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_TRADE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_TRADE.1"
msgid "Alright, alright, get a move on."
msgstr "Dobra, dobra. Nie ma co się puszyć."

#. STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_TRADE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_TRADE.2"
msgid "'Pleasure."
msgstr "Bardzo mi przyjemnie."

#. STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_TRADE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_TRADE.3"
msgid "Always in a rush, you lot."
msgstr "Wy to się zawsze się śpieszycie."

#. STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_TRADE.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_TRADE.4"
msgid "The plague ain't so bad, y'know."
msgstr "Ta zaraza nie jest taka najgorsza."

#. STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_TRADE.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_TRADE.5"
msgid "Come back now, y'hear?"
msgstr "Wróć tu jeszcze, dobrze?"

#. STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_TRADE.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_TRADE.6"
msgid "Who're you again?"
msgstr "Poczekaj... Kto ty jesteś?"

#. STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_TRADE.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM1_TALK_TRADE.7"
msgid "Thanks, stranger."
msgstr "Dziękuję, przybyszu."

#. STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_GREETING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_GREETING.1"
msgid "Good afternoon! Care to trade?"
msgstr "Dobry wieczór! Pohandlujemy?"

#. STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_GREETING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_GREETING.2"
msgid "At least the sickness didn't take my moustache. Ho ho!"
msgstr "Przynajmniej to choróbsko nie odebrało mi wąsów, ho ho!"

#. STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_GREETING.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_GREETING.3"
msgid "Sammy's faculties are slipping, but you didn't hear it from me."
msgstr "Sammy zaczyna się trochę gubić, ale ja ci tego nie mówiłem."

#. STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_GREETING.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_GREETING.4"
msgid "Many of our sick disappeared into the sea. Odd, that."
msgstr "Wielu chorych zniknęło w morzu. Dziwna sprawa."

#. STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_GREETING.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_GREETING.5"
msgid "Shame you couldn't see the town in its glory days."
msgstr "Trzeba ci było zobaczyć miasteczko dawniej. Piękne czasy."

#. STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_GREETING.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_GREETING.6"
msgid "I've only the finest goods for sale."
msgstr "Mam w sprzedaży wyłącznie najlepsze towary!"

#. STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_GREETING.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_GREETING.7"
msgid "This is a dreadful place for a kid to grow up in."
msgstr "To straszne miejsce dla dorastającego koźlątka."

#. STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_TRADE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_TRADE.1"
msgid "In a hurry, then?"
msgstr "Śpieszymy się, co?"

#. STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_TRADE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_TRADE.2"
msgid "Don't tarry now, friend."
msgstr "Nie zwlekaj."

#. STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_TRADE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_TRADE.3"
msgid "I'll not waste anymore of your time."
msgstr "Nie będę marnował więcej twojego czasu."

#. STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_TRADE.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_TRADE.4"
msgid "I tip my hat to you."
msgstr "Chylę kapelusza."

#. STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_TRADE.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_TRADE.5"
msgid "It's been a pleasure."
msgstr "Cała przyjemność po mojej stronie."

#. STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_TRADE.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM2_TALK_TRADE.6"
msgid "Gnaw smile on you."
msgstr "Piękny masz uśmiech."

#. STRINGS.MERM_TALK_CLOSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM_TALK_CLOSED.1"
msgid "Ya talk to ol'Mumsy yet?"
msgstr "Mamusia już z tobą rozmawiała?"

#. STRINGS.MERM_TALK_CLOSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM_TALK_CLOSED.2"
msgid "I ain't taking business right now."
msgstr "Mam teraz przerwę."

#. STRINGS.MERM_TALK_CLOSED.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM_TALK_CLOSED.3"
msgid "Don't keep the lady waiting."
msgstr "Nie każ pani czekać."

#. STRINGS.MERM_TALK_CLOSED.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.MERM_TALK_CLOSED.4"
msgid "Speak with Mumsy. Hurry on, then."
msgstr "Pomów z Mamusią. Śmiało."

#. STRINGS.MODS.VERSIONING.OUT_OF_DATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.MODS.VERSIONING.OUT_OF_DATE"
msgid "Mod \"%s\" is out of date. The server needs to get the latest version from the Steam Workshop so other users can join."
msgstr "Modyfikacja \"%s\" jest przeterminowana. Serwer musi pobrać najnowszą wersję modyfikacji z platformy Steam Workshop, aby inni użytkownicy mogli dołączyć."

